  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 909.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 909.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to implement RSA 485-A:24, II relative to operators of youth skill camps maintaining and implementing an appropriate policy regarding background checks for camp owners, employees, and volunteers who might be left alone with any child or children and certifying to the department that no such individual has a criminal conviction for the offenses listed therein.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 900) #12364, eff 9-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq900.html"
}
